Street Surgeon (c) 1994 - Version 1.0

This is going to be a very simple doc, just explaining how to set the door
up.  Street Surgeon version 1.0 was written in REXX and compiled with
RexxPlus.  Thanks to Jonas Hallman, my BETA tester (and European Support
site) we have gotten all the BUGS out of this door.  I hope you like it!

For game playing information please read the internal players doc.

Street Surgeon is ShareWare - please support the concept.

Setup:

1.  Copy the file StreetS to your Doors: directory.

2.  Make a directory call SS in your Doors: directory. (SS will make if not)

3.  If you have the SSKeyFile (Registration Key) copy it to the SS directory.

4.  Set the door up as the following:

[ 1] Letter:                  S (doesn't matter)
[ 2] Executable: (path/name)  Doors:StreetS %UNAME %ANSI %LEVEL
[ 4] Description:             Street Surgeon
[ 5] Type:                    Executable
[ 6] Help File:               DOORS/S (doesn't matter)
[ 7] Lower level:             50 (doesn't matter)
[ 8] Upper level:             255 (doesn't matter)
[ 9] Hidden:                  NO
[10] Load type:               OVERLAY
[11] Ask user if sure:        NO (doesn't matter)
[12] Pend messages:           YES (doesn't matter)
[13] Cli Mode:                YES (IMPORTANT!)
[14] Pause on completion:     NO (doesn't matter)
[15] Log Value:               150 (doesn't matter)
[16] Activity string:         Playing Street Surgeon (doesn't matter)
[17] Priority:                DEFAULT
[18] Edit Help File:

5.  Run the door first, or the user will be able to enter the Sysop info!

It's now ready!

